# .NET secrets
# Note: appsettings.json and appsettings.Development.json are tracked
# by .NET convention — keep them free of secrets. Personal/local
# overrides go in *.Local.json or in dotnet user-secrets (see
# QuantamAnalytics.Api.csproj <UserSecretsId>).
appsettings.Local.json
appsettings.*.local.json

